Another general Chapter 3B search wave is unlikely to add much value: the main patterns are corroborated across NGO, UN, official, domestic, and specialist sources. A narrowly targeted archival wave could still materially improve **3B.2–3B.4** through prosecution and command-chain records, **3B.3** through complete 2022 presidential audiovisual transcripts, and **3B.10** through comparable longitudinal casualty and victimization data.
